WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:04.440
I'm sorry.

00:04.440 --> 00:06.990
Thank you for coming
all the way to Ikebukuro.

00:06.990 --> 00:09.660
No. I'm glad we met.

00:09.660 --> 00:12.200
Even if it's just the time
until your prep school.

00:16.790 --> 00:19.000
I wonder if it's
going well for Nikoru.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.670
Yamana said that she's
on a date with Sekiya today.

00:22.670 --> 00:23.500
Yeah.

00:23.500 --> 00:26.840
It's been more than two weeks
since the cultural festival.

00:27.420 --> 00:28.170
Woah...

00:28.170 --> 00:30.130
Senior, look!

00:30.130 --> 00:34.100
Nikoru said she's definitely
going to make a move tonight.

00:34.410 --> 00:36.060
Make a move?

00:36.060 --> 00:37.850
Does that mean...

00:38.430 --> 00:40.060
That kind of thing?

00:40.060 --> 00:41.730
That's how it is.

00:41.730 --> 00:44.160
Because it's three years'
worth of feelings.

00:44.160 --> 00:46.530
It's natural that
she can't hold back.

00:46.530 --> 00:47.780
Well...

00:48.530 --> 00:49.590
I think you're right.

00:49.990 --> 00:52.740
Lately, Nikoru has been really cute.

00:52.740 --> 00:56.950
Looks like spring has come to her,
and seeing her warms my heart.

00:56.950 --> 00:59.660
Oh, by the way, what about Ijichi?

00:59.660 --> 01:02.380
He's been absent from school
since then, hasn't he?

01:02.960 --> 01:06.460
To say the least,
it's an extremely cold blizzard.

01:07.670 --> 01:10.550
He's channeling the shock
of being rejected into the game.

01:10.550 --> 01:14.300
Cold, so cold, my heart is cold!

01:15.100 --> 01:16.510
Nishi is also...

01:17.890 --> 01:19.310
Various things happened...

01:20.850 --> 01:23.230
And he's not feeling well right now.

01:23.230 --> 01:27.190
I see. I hope we can all play
together again.

01:28.530 --> 01:29.150
Yeah.

01:36.830 --> 01:41.160
Like playing airsoft or doing
something new together sounds fun.

01:41.160 --> 01:42.580
Do you have something in mind?

01:44.170 --> 01:45.650
Anything is fine, really.

01:45.650 --> 01:48.170
You seem busy with
practice exams and stuff.

01:48.170 --> 01:49.260
But...

01:49.880 --> 01:52.630
Thanks. Let me know
if you think of something.

01:52.630 --> 01:55.600
PEDESTRIAN AND CYCLIST ONLY

01:57.850 --> 02:00.480
Well, I'll stop by the convenience
store and head home.

02:00.480 --> 02:01.270
Okay.

02:30.250 --> 02:36.090
OUR DATING STORY: THE EXPERIENCED YOU
AND THE INEXPERIENCED ME

03:48.000 --> 03:53.420
YOU WERE EXPERIENCED, I WAS NOT:
OUR PARTING WAYS STORY.

03:53.420 --> 03:55.170
And then...

03:55.630 --> 03:58.090
Oh, Nikoru, you finally came!

03:58.090 --> 04:01.140
I was curious.
You never read my messages.

04:01.140 --> 04:04.930
Since the aquarium date, have you been
staying overnight with Senior?

04:04.930 --> 04:06.600
That's what Luna was gossiping about—

04:08.980 --> 04:09.950
Nikoru?

04:10.770 --> 04:11.360
See ya!

04:11.360 --> 04:13.730
I got rejected...

04:15.230 --> 04:17.200
What?

04:17.899 --> 04:18.990
What do you mean?

04:19.660 --> 04:22.070
He wants to focus on exams.

04:22.580 --> 04:24.620
Said he won't contact me at all,

04:24.620 --> 04:26.620
and even if I reach out,
he won't respond...

04:26.980 --> 04:28.080
He said...

04:28.620 --> 04:30.580
I can forget about him.

04:35.840 --> 04:37.720
Even the demon gal sheds tears...

04:38.080 --> 04:41.300
Huh?! What did you say?
If you want to laugh, just laugh!

04:42.720 --> 04:44.760
I didn't mean it like that!

04:45.390 --> 04:47.020
I heard about it, Sekiya.

04:47.390 --> 04:49.480
Why did you do that to Yamana?

04:49.480 --> 04:51.060
It can't be helped.

04:51.600 --> 04:57.440
If I continue dating her, it won't just
end with holding hands on dates.

04:58.820 --> 05:02.410
She's leaking her desires
for the future.

05:02.410 --> 05:05.660
If you want to show off,
just say it!

05:05.660 --> 05:07.370
I can guess.

05:07.750 --> 05:10.330
Once it happens,

05:10.330 --> 05:12.790
there's a streak of days
spent in hotels or at home.

05:13.500 --> 05:15.340
And before you know it,

05:15.840 --> 05:17.800
exams are over.

05:17.800 --> 05:19.720
In various ways...

05:19.720 --> 05:20.630
Huh?

05:20.630 --> 05:23.760
If that's the case, you want her
to wait until the exams are over.

05:24.220 --> 05:27.060
I think you still don't understand.

05:27.520 --> 05:32.270
How dense and special
high school years are.

05:33.400 --> 05:35.310
So that's why we have to break up.

05:35.860 --> 05:38.530
Keeping things vague
is not a good idea.

05:40.820 --> 05:41.950
Vague?

05:43.110 --> 05:44.950
Well, no worries.

05:45.320 --> 05:47.580
She has good friends around.

05:47.580 --> 05:48.910
After crying,

05:48.910 --> 05:51.540
she'll forget about me easily.

05:52.500 --> 05:54.080
Is that so?

05:54.080 --> 05:55.570
So, how about you guys?

05:55.570 --> 05:58.350
Things have been going well
since the cultural festival, right?

05:58.350 --> 05:59.090
Hm?

05:59.630 --> 06:04.090
Surface-wise, it's calm.
But... it feels awkward.

06:04.090 --> 06:07.850
If I say something unnecessary,
I might hurt her again.

06:08.390 --> 06:12.890
Actually... I've been feeling
distant from Ryuto lately.

06:12.890 --> 06:13.640
Eh?

06:13.640 --> 06:18.230
I can't see his heart.
No, I'm scared to look at it.

06:18.230 --> 06:20.780
So... I can't communicate well.

06:20.780 --> 06:22.030
Luna...

06:22.030 --> 06:23.740
We might...

06:24.110 --> 06:25.870
It might not be possible anymore.

06:26.530 --> 06:29.700
I'm sorry.
I was supposed to encourage you.

06:37.630 --> 06:40.800
In the past, when I confessed to Kurose,

06:40.800 --> 06:43.090
it was an irrevocable fact...

06:43.090 --> 06:45.640
I try to be careful not to
talk to her anymore...

06:46.050 --> 06:49.560
So as not to make her anxious...

06:49.560 --> 06:52.730
Huh? Hey, are you still a virgin?

06:52.730 --> 06:54.770
Oh wait, you are.

06:55.230 --> 06:56.420
If you keep saying that,

06:56.420 --> 07:00.480
you won't have any female friends
besides your girlfriend.

07:01.280 --> 07:02.110
It's fine.

07:02.650 --> 07:03.400
Say what?

07:03.800 --> 07:06.450
From the start,
the concept of having female friends,

07:06.450 --> 07:09.950
didn't really exist
in my world as an introvert.

07:10.450 --> 07:13.580
I had a new world open up

07:13.580 --> 07:15.500
because I started dating Luna.

07:16.080 --> 07:18.750
If it weren't for her,
I wouldn't have gone to Harajuku,

07:18.750 --> 07:20.670
ridden a boat, or gone to a summer festival.

07:21.050 --> 07:24.340
I might have graduated from high school
without ever doing those things.

07:25.340 --> 07:26.760
If Luna weren't there,

07:26.760 --> 07:30.220
I wouldn't have had a single
conversation with Yamana and the others.

07:30.720 --> 07:34.180
Everything... Everything happened
because she was there.

07:41.570 --> 07:42.270
Nikoru!

07:52.030 --> 07:54.580
We're really pitiful.

07:54.950 --> 07:57.620
Luna was the beginning of it all.

07:57.620 --> 08:00.540
So, rather than losing her,

08:00.540 --> 08:03.590
I don't need any other close girls.

08:09.140 --> 08:11.640
I kinda envy you, man.

08:12.140 --> 08:14.350
If I could go back
three years like you...

08:14.850 --> 08:16.100
Sekiya?

08:16.100 --> 08:17.770
Nah, it's nothing.

08:22.360 --> 08:25.280
Nikoru, I've decided.

08:35.409 --> 08:36.539
Kurose?

08:37.539 --> 08:39.830
Once again, our time
together has come.

08:47.420 --> 08:49.300
Well, I'm going this way.

08:50.340 --> 08:51.260
Hey...

08:52.300 --> 08:55.770
We probably shouldn't
talk alone anymore.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.060
Yeah.

08:57.980 --> 08:59.690
You know, Kashima...

08:59.690 --> 09:03.810
I don't think the feelings I had
for you will disappear so easily.

09:03.810 --> 09:06.900
But after the sports festival,

09:06.900 --> 09:09.070
I couldn't stop thinking about Luna.

09:11.030 --> 09:13.660
Ever since we were little,

09:13.660 --> 09:15.890
whenever I said I wanted something,

09:15.890 --> 09:18.250
she would always give it to me.

09:22.370 --> 09:23.540
Even if...

09:23.540 --> 09:27.000
it was something
really important to her.

09:28.550 --> 09:30.260
So, I'm worried...

09:30.260 --> 09:34.430
Luna might end up letting go
of you if things continue like this.

09:34.970 --> 09:37.520
I absolutely don't want
that to happen.

09:37.520 --> 09:39.770
I want Luna to be happy.

09:40.350 --> 09:41.690
I...

09:41.690 --> 09:44.150
I truly feel that way right now,

09:44.150 --> 09:46.820
even if you might not believe me.

09:48.070 --> 09:51.900
I like you, but more than that,

09:51.900 --> 09:53.700
I think I like Luna more.

09:54.410 --> 09:55.740
As you suggested,

09:56.120 --> 09:59.500
let's stop talking to each other.

10:03.000 --> 10:03.710
Kurose...

10:05.420 --> 10:06.590
I...

10:06.590 --> 10:08.500
I have zero experience,

10:08.500 --> 10:10.840
but it's not like
I've never been in love.

10:11.760 --> 10:14.260
My first love...

10:15.010 --> 10:16.350
was with you.

10:19.640 --> 10:20.520
Thank you.

10:24.940 --> 10:27.110
Thank you, Kashima.

10:28.020 --> 10:29.860
It's more than enough.

10:41.660 --> 10:42.750
What is it?

10:42.750 --> 10:46.210
Um... I just wanna hear your voice.

10:46.690 --> 10:49.420
I see.
This is perfect timing.

10:49.420 --> 10:50.920
You see, Ryuto...

10:52.130 --> 10:54.130
I...

10:54.130 --> 10:55.440
Kurose?

10:58.680 --> 10:59.640
Kurose!

11:05.190 --> 11:06.980
Kurose, are you alright?

11:07.440 --> 11:08.860
Are you hurt somewhere?

11:08.860 --> 11:10.360
Kashima...

11:12.990 --> 11:16.470
There have been frequent cases
of harassment near that shrine.

11:18.410 --> 11:22.290
That must have been tough.
May I ask you a few questions?

11:22.290 --> 11:23.330
Sure...

11:24.160 --> 11:26.290
Huh... It's gone?

11:26.290 --> 11:27.630
Did you lose something?

11:27.630 --> 11:30.380
Yes. Seems like I lost my earring.

11:30.380 --> 11:31.880
Are you her friend?

11:32.280 --> 11:35.760
No, we're classmates.
Just happened to pass by.

11:35.760 --> 11:38.840
I see. We'll take it from here.

11:41.510 --> 11:43.310
It must have been tough.

11:43.310 --> 11:45.680
I've informed Mom,

11:45.680 --> 11:48.350
and she said she'll
pick up Maria soon.

11:48.350 --> 11:49.490
Thank you.

11:50.810 --> 11:51.860
Luna...

11:51.860 --> 11:53.820
About why I am with Kurose,

11:53.820 --> 11:55.990
I want to explain properly.

11:56.620 --> 11:58.110
Let's talk about it next time.

11:58.110 --> 11:58.990
Huh?

11:58.990 --> 12:01.780
Next Saturday, in front of
the prep school again.

12:01.780 --> 12:04.200
I have something
I want to tell you too.

12:12.090 --> 12:14.170
Um... about what I said the other night...

12:14.170 --> 12:17.010
It's scary, huh?
Being a victim of harassment.

12:17.010 --> 12:18.890
I'm just glad Maria didn't get hurt.

12:18.890 --> 12:20.550
Ah, yeah...

12:21.220 --> 12:23.890
On that day, I was with Kurose...

12:23.890 --> 12:26.020
It's fine. It's enough.

12:26.670 --> 12:28.020
But I don't want to be misunder—

12:28.020 --> 12:29.730
Really, it's enough.

12:32.360 --> 12:36.360
I don't want to show you any
more unpleasant sides of me,

12:38.530 --> 12:39.410
so let's break up.

12:51.380 --> 12:53.790
It's not because of
what happened this time.

12:53.790 --> 12:57.130
I've decided to tell
you even before this.

12:57.130 --> 12:57.970
Eh?

12:57.970 --> 13:00.490
You felt that way too, didn't you?

13:01.800 --> 13:03.930
Well, it doesn't matter anymore.

13:05.140 --> 13:09.180
At the very end,
I experienced something new...

13:09.180 --> 13:12.150
I decided to be the one
to initiate the breakup.

13:13.190 --> 13:16.030
Even though it's not
a happy first experience.

13:18.400 --> 13:21.660
I wanted to experience
more firsts with you...

13:25.700 --> 13:27.490
But, you know, it can't be helped.

13:28.580 --> 13:31.500
I'm glad I could be with you.

13:31.500 --> 13:32.710
Thank you so much.

13:33.960 --> 13:36.300
More than anything, I...

13:37.920 --> 13:39.590
Oh right, hey...

13:40.130 --> 13:41.560
Let's go shopping after this.

13:41.560 --> 13:42.590
Yeah, that sounds good.

14:31.890 --> 14:36.020
The goal I had during high school,
has already been achieved.

14:36.020 --> 14:38.070
Come on! This way!

14:40.150 --> 14:42.530
"Being with someone you think
you can always be with,

14:42.530 --> 14:44.200
and falling in love with them." it is.

14:47.990 --> 14:51.470
I'll be a mom, having lots of children,

14:51.470 --> 14:53.870
always loving their dad,

14:53.870 --> 14:56.750
and being affectionate
even in front of the kid!

15:13.060 --> 15:15.270
It is impossible...

15:16.230 --> 15:17.900
I don't want to break up!

15:19.860 --> 15:24.780
I only told Kurose
to stop talking to each other.

15:24.780 --> 15:26.910
Why would you
misunderstand it like that!

15:27.370 --> 15:30.660
I... I don't want to!

15:31.160 --> 15:33.790
I don't want to break up!
But I can't change the past!

15:34.620 --> 15:36.370
What should I do?!

15:37.710 --> 15:40.460
Sorry... I'm sorry, Ryuto.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.590
I don't understand either...

15:43.630 --> 15:45.050
I don't know, but...

15:45.050 --> 15:48.680
But I love you so much, Ryuto.

15:49.220 --> 15:53.520
I really do,
but I'm scared of you hating me.

15:53.520 --> 15:57.190
I've become anxious
about loving you...

15:57.640 --> 15:59.860
Even though I know
I can't change the past,

15:59.860 --> 16:02.900
I understand it better
than anyone else!

16:03.440 --> 16:06.650
I don't want to say such things to you,
but I don't know what to do.

16:06.650 --> 16:08.160
Just tell me!

16:08.480 --> 16:11.200
I don't want to say things
like this to you!

16:12.120 --> 16:13.520
Tell me anything!

16:13.520 --> 16:15.080
Even if it's something terrible,

16:15.080 --> 16:17.580
or unpleasant,
I don't care! Just tell me!

16:17.580 --> 16:20.460
I might end up hating myself...

16:20.460 --> 16:22.090
I love you!

16:22.090 --> 16:24.550
There's no way I'll hate you!

16:26.510 --> 16:30.470
It's okay to be wrong!
We're still high school students!

16:30.470 --> 16:33.850
Let's make mistakes together!
Clash together!

16:33.850 --> 16:36.640
I want to become an adult with you!

16:36.640 --> 16:37.600
Ryuto...

16:52.870 --> 16:56.500
I'm sorry...
I was the one who was wrong!

16:59.790 --> 17:01.250
I was wrong...

17:02.830 --> 17:04.380
Luna!

17:12.089 --> 17:13.390
Ah sorry!

17:13.390 --> 17:14.300
We're sorry!

17:25.569 --> 17:29.400
I'm sorry. The prep school
classes are over, right?

17:29.400 --> 17:30.570
It's fine.

17:30.570 --> 17:33.240
I can recover in about one meeting.

17:35.990 --> 17:36.990
I...

17:36.990 --> 17:40.410
Somehow, I applied a brake to my feelings
for you without realizing it.

17:42.250 --> 17:46.300
You used to say
I was like a sports car...

17:46.300 --> 17:48.840
It wasn't really like me, was it?

17:49.970 --> 17:52.340
I think... I'll let it slide for now.

17:53.050 --> 17:53.800
But...

17:54.190 --> 17:56.230
I don't want you
to hit the brakes anymore.

17:56.760 --> 17:58.520
Okay, got it.

17:58.520 --> 18:01.480
I'll be prepared to keep loving you
no matter where we spin!

18:01.480 --> 18:02.730
Prepare yourself, okay?

18:24.460 --> 18:25.210
Ah!

18:25.210 --> 18:27.790
I haven't apologized to you.

18:27.790 --> 18:28.590
Eh?

18:28.590 --> 18:31.840
I can no longer cooperate
with that' Friendship Plan.'

18:32.380 --> 18:34.130
I... well,

18:34.130 --> 18:36.180
I stopped being friends with Kurose.

18:37.180 --> 18:38.060
Sorry...

18:39.140 --> 18:40.350
No...

18:40.350 --> 18:45.020
The reason I wanted to become with
Maria was not as friends but as sisters.

18:45.560 --> 18:48.860
I guess she dislikes me
even more now.

18:49.440 --> 18:51.030
I don't think that's true.

18:51.030 --> 18:53.650
I believe Kurose actually...

18:54.070 --> 18:57.660
About this earring,
I gave the other one to Maria.

18:57.660 --> 18:58.280
Hm?

18:59.120 --> 19:02.200
When we decided to live separately.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.910
I thought that when we became adults,

19:03.910 --> 19:06.040
I'd like us to wear them
together someday.

19:06.040 --> 19:07.710
Earrings...

19:07.710 --> 19:11.000
But Maria probably lost
hers a long time ago.

19:13.590 --> 19:15.550
Ah! The earring!

19:28.940 --> 19:30.070
I found it!

19:30.070 --> 19:30.860
Ah!

19:31.270 --> 19:33.030
This is... Maria's...

19:33.030 --> 19:34.860
Kurose told me.

19:34.860 --> 19:36.860
The reason she transferred
to our school

19:37.440 --> 19:39.870
was because she wanted you to be happy.

19:40.330 --> 19:44.500
Meaning her true feelings
haven't changed since then?

19:44.500 --> 19:45.330
Yes.

19:47.120 --> 19:48.790
Thank you, Ryuto.

19:49.960 --> 19:54.380
Thanks to you, I feel like I can regain
something precious that I had lost.

19:56.430 --> 19:59.470
So, Kurose's English composition
has been selected

19:59.470 --> 20:02.010
as an outstanding National Award!

20:07.310 --> 20:10.560
Amazing, Maria!
You're my proud little sister!

20:12.520 --> 20:13.280
Huh?

20:13.280 --> 20:14.480
Eh? What?

20:14.480 --> 20:15.530
Ha?

20:17.450 --> 20:19.950
Oh? Didn't I mention it before?

20:19.950 --> 20:22.910
Maria and I are twin sisters.

20:22.910 --> 20:26.120
Our parents are divorced,
so we have different last names.

20:26.120 --> 20:27.410
Right, Maria?

20:38.470 --> 20:40.800
Wait! What's that all of sudden?

20:41.280 --> 20:41.930
Here.

20:42.890 --> 20:43.720
That's...

20:44.760 --> 20:47.850
Ryuto and I searched it for you.
I'm glad we found it!

20:50.060 --> 20:52.480
You... You had it all along?

20:53.320 --> 20:54.400
Of course.

20:56.030 --> 20:59.950
I'm sorry, Maria.
I should have done this sooner.

21:00.410 --> 21:03.910
When you transferred here,
I was so happy.

21:04.910 --> 21:05.870
Luna...

21:11.290 --> 21:14.290
I had a feeling something was strange.

21:14.290 --> 21:16.880
You should've told us sooner!

21:16.880 --> 21:18.130
Yeah, yeah!

21:18.130 --> 21:20.260
Say, from now on,

21:20.260 --> 21:21.760
can I call you Marimellow?

21:23.890 --> 21:25.310
- Cute right?
- Marimellow?

21:25.310 --> 21:27.020
I might secretly be a genius!

21:27.020 --> 21:29.520
I think I will go for Kurose!

21:31.520 --> 21:34.360
And so, Luna's 'Friendship Plan...'

21:34.360 --> 21:37.070
concluded as the 'Sisters Plan.'

21:37.610 --> 21:40.030
The first winter I welcomed with Luna...

21:40.360 --> 21:42.410
Will surely be warm...

21:47.290 --> 21:50.460
I wonder if you can hold me tight...

21:50.460 --> 21:55.000
Eh? Huh? What?

23:27.010 --> 23:28.550
Next time in Kimizero:

23:28.550 --> 23:33.520
"You Were Experienced, I Was Not:
Our Experiencing Things Together Story."

23:34.350 --> 23:36.600
What is that? Also, the end?

23:36.600 --> 23:37.980
Ain't the vibes just right?

23:37.980 --> 23:40.020
YOU WERE EXPERIENCED, I WAS NOT:
OUR EXPERIENCING THINGS TOGETHER STORY
